OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain lingering      
OL,6,Facross northern areas, heavy at times. 
OL,7,FFurther south staying mainly dry but   
OL,8,Fgenerally cloudy, perhaps with some    
OL,9,Fbright or sunny spells. Feeling rather 
OL,10,Fcold with temperatures slightly below  
OL,11,Faverage.                               
OL,13,CTonight:FStarting with outbreaks of    
OL,14,Frain across northern areas, and drier  
OL,15,Ffurther south. Overnight outbreaks of  
OL,16,Fmainly light rain move southwards,     
OL,17,Fwith Nottinghamshire and Derbyshire    
OL,18,Flikely to become dry.                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
